  "solution": "**Concept used:**\n\n• If (x + 1/x) = a then (x - 1/x) = √(a² - 4)\n\n• If x + 1/x = a, then (x³ + 1/x³) = a³ - 3a\n\n• If x - 1/x = a, then (x³ - 1/x³) = a³ + 3a\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n (x+(1)/(x))=2√2, then (x - 1/x) = √(8 - 4) = 2\n\n (x⁶-(1)/(x⁶))\n\n⇒ (x³)² - (1/x³)²\n\n⇒ (x³ + 1/x³) (x³ - 1/x³)\n\n⇒ [(2√2)³ - 3(2√2)] [2³ + 3 × 2]\n\n⇒ [16√2 - 6√2] × 14\n\n⇒ 10√2 × 14\n\n⇒ 140√2\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 140√2**",
